---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import IconSendMail from "../components/icons/IconSendMail.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import { Size } from "../types/Size";
import message from "../imgs/message-sent.svg";
---

<section class="padding-y-xl section">
  <SectionHeader title="About me" />
  <div class="content margin-x-xxl margin-top-xxl">
    <section>
      <p>
        Hello there! My name is Adrián and I am a junior programmer who was born
        and raised in Spain. I have always had a passion for technology, and I
        am always curious about the latest trends and advancements in this
        field.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a programmer, I enjoy the challenge of finding innovative solutions
        to complex problems. I find great satisfaction in turning my ideas into
        reality through coding, and I am constantly looking for ways to improve
        my skills and expand my knowledge.
      </p>
      <p>
        In addition to programming, I enjoy exploring new technology and
        gadgets. I find it fascinating to see how technology has evolved over
        time and how it continues to shape the world we live in today. My
        curiosity about technology extends beyond just software and programming,
        and I am always eager to learn about new hardware and devices as well.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not working on a project or discovering new technology, you can
        usually find me playing video games. Gaming is another one of my hobbies
        that I enjoy in my free time. I find it to be a great way to unwind and
        relax after a long day of coding.
      </p>
      <p>
        One of the qualities that sets me apart from others is my proactive
        approach to work and life. I am always looking for ways to improve
        myself, take on new challenges, and find solutions to problems. This
        proactive mindset is what drives me to constantly learn and grow in my
        field, and I believe it is a key factor in my success as a programmer.
      </p>
      <p>
        Thank you for taking the time to read my about me page. If you have any
        questions or would like to connect, feel free to reach out to me!
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="contact">
      <h2>Contact me</h2>
      <Button
        variant="secondary"
        size={Size.LG}
        label="Via email"
        href="mailto:adrian@adrianr.dev"><IconSendMail /></Button
      >
      <Image src={message} alt=""></Image>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .content {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xxl);
    flex-grow: 0;
  }
  .contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 25%;
  }

  h2,
  p:first-of-type {
    margin: 0;
  }

  img {
    width: 90%;
  }
</style>
